name: sim.setColorProperty
description: Sets a color property (float[3])
luaSynopsis: sim.setColorProperty(int target, string propertyName, list propertyState, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: sim.setColorProperty(int target, string propertyName, float[3] propertyState, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. propertyName: property name
3. propertyState: property value
4. options: an optional map. Set options.noError to true for silent errors
outputs:
